      "content": [
        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "## Finding: work order verified; event-level conclusion remains unverified\n\nThe relevant manufacturing order is **MO-25-09-1070**, work order **WO-2025-09-004**, for **Cooler Plate Pack** at Modine’s Racine–Dekoven operation.\n\n| Required item | Verified result |\n|---|---|\n| September cost period | **Sep-25 — PER-COST-2025-09** |\n| Exact Pending Close time | **2025-09-30T18:00:00** |\n| Source transaction | Cannot verify from authorized records |\n| Event amount | Cannot verify |\n| Exact event-created time | Cannot verify |\n| Minutes after Pending Close | Cannot calculate without the event-created time |\n| Recorded accounting status | Cannot verify |\n| Status consistent with Oracle policy? | **Undetermined** |\n\nThe available work-order and cost-period records establish the order and cutoff, but contain **no cost-event rows**. The supporting event records are restricted to a records-custodian. I requested an authorized extract, but none was available. This absence from the accessible projection **does not establish that no late event occurred**.\n\n### Oracle’s documented treatment\n\nOracle Fusion Cloud SCM Cost Management 26B, **“Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting,” PDF page 233 / printed page 225**, states that newly created transactions falling in or before a Pending Close period are not staged or processed until the period is closed or reopened. Transactions entered before Pending Close continue processing, even if in error.\n\nThe documented exceptions are **revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments**, which continue processing after Pending Close. Consequently, the event’s type, creation time, and recorded status are necessary to assess consistency; I cannot responsibly conclude “consistent” or “inconsistent” without them.\n\n**No database records were changed.** The partial audit and provenance were saved to `/cache/work/worker_a0d9dcfaefa8/audit-report.json`; the submitted report remains marked **needs evidence**.",
          "annotations": [],
          "logprobs": []
        }
      ],
      "phase": "final_answer"
    }
  ],
